THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This application bundles the OpenRGB lighting engine
(https://openrgb.org / https://gitlab.com/CalcProgrammer1/OpenRGB), which is
licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0. OpenRGB is shipped as a
SEPARATE, UNMODIFIED BINARY embedded as a resource inside FullRGB.exe and
extracted to disk before it is executed as its own process. FullRGB
communicates with it only over its documented local TCP SDK protocol.

The complete corresponding source for the bundled OpenRGB binaries is
available from the upstream project at the URL above. The engine binaries in
this repository live under `vendor/OpenRGB/`.

Other bundled NuGet dependencies:
  * LibreHardwareMonitorLib 0.9.4 - MPL-2.0
  * NAudio 2.2.1 - MIT
